{"seq":2,"slug":"hash-partitioning","title":"哈希分片","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-sharding-partitioning/strategies/hash-partitioning","wordCount":1645,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"哈希分片\">哈希分片</h1><p>哈希分片用一个看似粗暴的动作解决了范围分片最头疼的问题：对分区键取哈希，再用哈希值决定分片。<code>shard = hash(key) % N</code>——一行公式，就把单调递增键、长尾热门值、任何带有「结构」的分布全部碾平成近乎均匀的随机散布。它是 Cassandra、DynamoDB 等系统的默认分布方式，但这份均匀不是免费的：它彻底牺牲了范围查询的局部性，而那个不起眼的 <code>% N</code> 还埋着一个会在扩容时引爆的炸弹。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>哈希分片的关键在于哈希函数把输入的任何分布映射成输出空间上的均匀分布。一个高基数的分区键经过好的哈希函数后，相邻的键会被打到完全不相关的分片上，热点值也被稀释。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[分区键 key] --&gt; B[哈希函数 hash key]&#10;    B --&gt; C[哈希值 h]&#10;    C --&gt; D{对 N 取模}&#10;    D --&gt;|h%N=0| E[分片 0]&#10;    D --&gt;|h%N=1| F[分片 1]&#10;    D --&gt;|h%N=2| G[分片 2]&#10;    H[相邻键 100/101/102] -.被打散.-&gt; E&#10;    H -.被打散.-&gt; F&#10;    H -.被打散.-&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n    A[分区键 key] --&gt; B[哈希函数 hash key]\n    B --&gt; C[哈希值 h]\n    C --&gt; D{对 N 取模}\n    D --&gt;|h%N=0| E[分片 0]\n    D --&gt;|h%N=1| F[分片 1]\n    D --&gt;|h%N=2| G[分片 2]\n    H[相邻键 100/101/102] -.被打散.-&gt; E\n    H -.被打散.-&gt; F\n    H -.被打散.-&gt; G</pre><p>下表对比哈希分片在不同维度上的表现，以及它与一致性哈希的关系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>朴素哈希取模</th>\n<th>一致性哈希</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据均匀性</td>\n<td>好（取决于哈希函数质量）</td>\n<td>好（虚拟节点平滑）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围查询</td>\n<td>不支持，需全分片扫描</td>\n<td>同样不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增减一个分片</td>\n<td>几乎全量重分布</td>\n<td>仅影响相邻段约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>极简</td>\n<td>中等（需哈希环+虚拟节点）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>分片数固定</td>\n<td>分片数频繁变化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"均匀分布如何消灭写热点\">均匀分布如何消灭写热点</h2><p>哈希分片对写入分布的改善是立竿见影的。把 <a href=\"range-partitioning\">范围分片</a> 里那个单调递增键的尾部热点场景换成哈希分片：连续到来的自增 ID 经哈希后落点彼此无关，写入被均匀摊到所有分片上，写倾斜度从接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 回落到接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。这正是 Vitess 的 hash vindex 所做的——基于分片列的哈希把行均匀分布到各分片，确保数据分布平衡（<a href=\"https://vitess.io/docs/23.0/reference/features/vindexes/\">Vitess vindexes 文档</a>）。</p>\n<p>衡量均匀性，可以看各分片负载相对均值的方差。理想哈希下，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个键随机投入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个分片，每个分片期望承载 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个键，且偏离均值的相对幅度随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 增大而收敛：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>load</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mfrac><mi>σ</mi><mi>μ</mi></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[\\text{load}_i] = \\frac{M}{N}, \\quad \\frac{\\sigma}{\\mu} \\approx \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{M/N}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">load</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4514em;vertical-align:-1.13em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.175em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.13em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是说数据量越大，哈希分布越平。这解释了为什么哈希分片在大规模下几乎总能保持均匀——前提是分区键本身高基数（见 <a href=\"../foundations/partition-keys\">分区键的选择</a>）。需要警惕的是，哈希也救不了「单值过热」：若某一个分区键值（如某个超级账户）本身占了海量数据，哈希只会把它整块扔到一个分片，倾斜照旧，这类问题留给 <a href=\"../challenges/hotspots-skew\">热点与数据倾斜</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"牺牲范围局部性的代价\">牺牲范围局部性的代价</h2><p>哈希的均匀来自打散，而打散正是范围查询的天敌。哈希分片下，连续的键被均匀撒到所有分片，于是「查 ID 在某区间内的所有记录」必须向每一个分片发起查询再合并结果——一个本可以单分片完成的范围扫描，退化成了全集群的散布-聚集（见 <a href=\"../challenges/cross-shard-queries\">跨分片查询与聚合</a>）。同理，依赖顺序的游标分页、<code>ORDER BY</code> 配合 <code>LIMIT</code> 的「取最新 N 条」在哈希分片上都变得昂贵。</p>\n<p>因此哈希分片与范围分片不是优劣关系，而是面向不同访问模式的取舍：点查为主、写入需均匀分散，选哈希；范围扫描为主、能容忍写热点或键非单调，选范围。很多系统会两者并用——对需要范围扫描的维度用范围分区，对需要均匀写入的维度用哈希分片，分别落在不同的表或层上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"取模法的扩容噩梦\">取模法的扩容噩梦</h2><p>朴素哈希取模 <code>hash(key) % N</code> 有个隐藏极深的缺陷：一旦分片数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 变了，几乎所有键的归属都会变。从 4 个分片扩到 5 个，<code>% 4</code> 变成 <code>% 5</code>，对绝大多数键来说取模结果都不同了——意味着集群里几乎每一行数据都要被搬到新的分片上。</p>\n<p>精确地说，从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个分片扩到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个，朴素取模下保持原位的键比例只有约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{N+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，需要迁移的比例高达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N}{N+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2757em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>需迁移比例</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mtext> 较大时</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{需迁移比例} = \\frac{N}{N+1} \\approx 1 \\quad (N \\text{ 较大时})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">需迁移比例</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">较大时</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这意味着一次扩容几乎等于全量数据重分布——在生产环境里这是灾难级的操作，会饱和网络、拖垮在线服务、且回滚困难。这个缺陷正是一致性哈希被发明出来要解决的核心问题，详见 <a href=\"directory-consistent-hashing\">目录分片与一致性哈希</a>。在那之前，工程上常用的权宜之计是预分片（pre-sharding）：一开始就把数据哈希到远多于物理机的逻辑分片（如 1024 个）上，扩容时只是把若干逻辑分片整体搬到新机器，避免重算哈希。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时选哈希分片\">何时选哈希分片</h2><p>哈希分片的判据清晰：写入需要均匀分散（尤其分区键单调递增）、查询以点查为主、且能接受范围查询的扇出代价时，它是默认且通常最优的选择。绝大多数「按用户 ID 分片」「按订单 ID 分片」的 OLTP 系统都属于这一类——它们既想要写入均匀，又主要做按主键的点查，哈希分片正中下怀。</p>\n<p>唯一需要在落地前就想清楚的，是扩容路径：直接用朴素取模会在第一次扩容时尝到苦果，所以现代系统要么用一致性哈希、要么用预分片把扩容的代价提前摊平。换句话说，选哈希分片的同时就要把「将来怎么加分片」这个问题一并解决，否则只是把痛苦推迟到了 <a href=\"../challenges/rebalancing-resharding\">再平衡与重分片</a> 那一天。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>哈希分片对分区键取哈希再分配，把任意分布碾平成近乎均匀的随机散布，消灭写热点。</li>\n<li>均匀性随数据量增大而收敛，是大规模 OLTP 点查系统的默认分布方式，前提是键高基数。</li>\n<li>代价是彻底牺牲范围查询局部性：连续区间扫描退化为全集群散布-聚集。</li>\n<li>朴素取模 <code>% N</code> 的致命缺陷是扩容时需迁移约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N/(N+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的数据，近乎全量重分布。</li>\n<li>解法是一致性哈希或预分片到大量逻辑分片，选哈希分片时必须同时定下扩容路径。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"哈希分片","id":"哈希分片"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"均匀分布如何消灭写热点","id":"均匀分布如何消灭写热点"},{"level":2,"text":"牺牲范围局部性的代价","id":"牺牲范围局部性的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"取模法的扩容噩梦","id":"取模法的扩容噩梦"},{"level":2,"text":"何时选哈希分片","id":"何时选哈希分片"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"范围分片","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-sharding-partitioning/strategies/range-partitioning"},"next":{"title":"目录分片与一致性哈希","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-sharding-partitioning/strategies/directory-consistent-hashing"}}